diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 1aec135..ed858fd 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -116,6 +116,14 @@ First build a conventional OpenWrt generic Octeon initramfs:
 ./rv220w.fish build initramfs
 ```
 
+After applying the RV220W platform update, build the board-specific RAM-validation image:
+
+```fish
+./rv220w.fish build rv220w-initramfs
+```
+
+The board-specific mode stages `rv220w-openwrt-rv220w-initramfs.elf` and does not flash NOR.
+
 Build the separate upstream Linux Octeon reference tree for comparison and future upstream work:
 
 ```fish
